              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘুষ — ghush — \"a bribe\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "চোর দারোগাকে টাকা দিতে চাইল, কিন্তু তিনি ঘুষ নিলেন না। chor dārogāke ṭākā dite chāilô, kintu tini ghush nilen nā. The thief tried to give the inspector money, but he would not take a bribe."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ঘুষ (ghush) is filed in CDIAL 4499 under a Middle Indo-Aryan ghūssā, 'a present', which lists Bengali ghus, 'a bribe': a present with a purpose."
            }
          ]
        },
